    {"[bold]Subject:[/bold] Operational Objectives - Sorokyne Strata AO"}
    {"[bold]Reference:[/bold] 48-77-AQ"}
    {"[bold]Classification:[/bold] [color=#cb0000][bold]CONFIDENTIAL[/bold][/color]"}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Commander,"}

    {"Sorokyne Strata is a UPP-controlled mining colony on LV-976."}

    {"Originally a Jùtóu Combine settlement (est. 2110), it was annexed by the Union of Progressive Peoples in 2166 following the Dog War."}

    {"The colony's lithium-carbon-silicon deposits are declining, creating economic instability and civil unrest."}

    {"Your mission is to respond to the colony's recent distress signal, determine the status of UPP forces, and secure all U.S. citizens and interests."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"[head=3][color=#8c0000]Primary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Establish a Forward Operating Base at a location with access to the central mining complex."}
    {"[bullet]Locate and evacuate any UA nationals and civilian contractors."}

    {"[head=3][color=#134975]Secondary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Survey key mine shafts for structural instability or sabotage."}
    {"[bullet]Gather intelligence on UPP troop deployments and PAP patrol routines."}
    {"[bullet]Maintain neutral posture unless directly engaged by UPP forces."}

    {"Maintain professional rules of engagement."}
    {"Diplomatic repercussions are possible."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Signed,"}
    {"[color=#dfc189][bolditalic]Second Lieutenant Lucas Harlan[/bolditalic][/color]"}
    {"[italic]Strategic Liaison Officer | 2nd Battalion, 3rd Regiment - 4th Combat Division[/italic]"}
    {"[color=#AAAAAA][italic]For the Corps.[/italic][/color]"}

    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
