    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Commander,"}

    {"Sorokyne Strata is a decaying Union of Progressive Peoples mining outpost."}

    {"The UPP maintains a small military presence and Cosmos Exploration Corps unit to guard lithium and silicon operations, but production has dropped sharply."}

    {"Intelligence suggests internal unrest as the primary cause, but be prepared for anything."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"[head=3][color=#8c0000]Primary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Establish a FOB in a location that secures high ground over UPP infrastructure and shaft entrances."}
    {"[bullet]Neutralize any suspicious activity and eliminate hostile forces if they interfere."}
    {"[bullet]Secure power stations and mine-head reactors to prevent sabotage or theft."}

    {"[head=3][color=#134975]Secondary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Collect UPP operational logs and troop strength data."}
    {"[bullet]Disable or capture UPP security communications relays."}
    {"[bullet]Deny further lithium exports until UA authorities regain leverage."}

    {"This colony is a chess piece in a long game."}
    {"Show the UPP the cost of encroachment."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Signed,"}
    {"[color=#dfc189][bolditalic]Colonel Margaret A.W. Shanks[/bolditalic][/color]"}
    {"[italic]United Nations Marine Corps | Colonial Protection Organization - 4th Combat Division[/italic]"}
    {"[color=#AAAAAA][italic]No mercy. No doubt.[/italic][/color]"}

    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
